            "sid": "ISA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazabona ishyano abategeka amategeko yo guca urwa kibera, n'abanditsi bandikira ibigoramye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo birengagize abakene badaca urubanza rwabo, bagahuguza abatindi bo mu bantu banjye, n'abapfakazi bakaba umunyago wabo, kandi impfubyi bazigira umuhigo wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None se ku munsi w'amakuba no mu irimbura rizaturuka kure muzamera mute? Muzahungira kuri nde ngo abakize, kandi icyubahiro cyawe uzagisiga he? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazacishwa bugufi babe hasi y'imbohe, kandi bazagwa babe munsi y'intumbi. Nyamara uburakari bw'Uwiteka ntiburashira, ahubwo ukuboko kwe kuracyabanguye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashuri hahanurirwa ko hazahanwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
